#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""secret-drop: hand a secret to a file, a server or the keychain without pasting it into a chat.

The value is typed into a native password dialog and written straight to its target. It never
appears in argv, logs or stdout; only its length is reported, so an AI agent can run this command
and keep working without ever seeing the secret.
"""

